 she can travel into The Further, the purgatorial realm of lost souls at the heart of the Insidious universe. When something evil comes after her,...              </span>\r\n\r\n                              <span class=\"synopsis-full hidden text-base\">\r\n                  Amelia Eve stars as Gemma, a young mother raising her daughter in the house she grew up in who discovers she can travel into The Further, the purgatorial realm of lost souls at the heart of the Insidious universe. When something evil comes after her, Gemma discovers an ability that changes everything: she doesn?t just enter The Further, she can bring what lives there back to the real world. Once the demons realise her power, our world becomes their playground.                </span>\r\n\r\n                <button \r\n                  type=\"button\"\r\n                  class=\"ml-2 text-ompYellow underline text-base\"\r\n                  onclick=\"toggleSynopsis(this)\"\r\n                >\r\n                  See more\r\n                </button>\r\n                          </p>\r\n          <div class=\"hallTypeIcon hidden\">\r\n                                  </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <!-- C -->\r\n      <div class=\"col-span-3 md:col-span-5 md:col-start-1\">\r\n        <div class=\"w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 sm:col-span-2 xl:grid-cols-3  gap-2\">\r\n          <a aria-label=\"Insidious: Out Of The Further at 13:00 in Screen 7\" href=\"https://www.omniplexcinemas.co.uk/booking/seats/sutton/48064\" class=\"\"> \r\n<div id=\"perf_0\" class=\"showTimeBox bg-ompGray-times p-2 col-span-1 rounded-xl\">\r\n  <div class=\"topSection flex justify-between items-end\">\r\n    <div class=\"flex items-end\">\r\n      <div class=\"flex items-baseline\">\r\n        <h4 class=\"bigText mr-1 leading-none\" aria-label=\"Insidious: Out Of The Further at 13:00 in Screen 7\">\r\n          13:00        </h4>\r\n        <p class=\"smallText leading-none\" aria-label=\"Insi