5 xl:col-span-8\">\r\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-5 gap-4 items-start\">\r\n      <!-- A (Mobile) -->\r\n      <div class=\"md:hidden col-span-1\">\r\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 grid-rows-1 w-full\">\r\n          <img\r\n            src=\"/filmimages/small/113414.jpg?v=1562469204\"\r\n            alt=\"Fall 2: Deadpoint Event poster\"\r\n            class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 w-full h-auto object-cover\"\r\n            data-eventCode=\"113414\"\r\n            data-eventCode=\"Fall 2: Deadpoint\"\r\n          />\r\n                      <img\r\n              onclick=\"playYoutubeVideo('Rsztt5qDj_A')\"\r\n              src=\"/public/assets/svgs/play-circle.svg\"\r\n              alt=\"Play Trailler\"\r\n              class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 self-center justify-self-center w-12 h-12\"\r\n            />\r\n                  </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <!-- B -->\r\n      <div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5\">\r\n        <div class=\"w-full\">\r\n          <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start w-full mb-2\">\r\n            <p class=\"font-medium text-lg sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl leading-snug sm:leading-tight md:leading-tight mr-4\">\r\n              <a href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/fall-2-deadpoint\">\r\n                Fall 2: Deadpoint              </a>\r\n            </p>\r\n            <img data-toggle=\"0\" id=\"favourite113414\" onClick=\"toggleFavourite('113414');return false;\" src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_favourited-off.svg\" class=\"w-4 mt-2 mx-3\" alt=\"Add to Favourites\" />  \r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\">\r\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\r\n              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n                <img src=\"/images/ratings/UK_12A.png\" class=\"w-4 min-w-[30px]\" />\r\n                <p class=\"text-base leading-snug font-normal leading-none\">Adventure, Thriller, Drama</p>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <p class=\"mb-2 md:m-auto flex item-center\"><span class=\"hidden md:flex mr-2\">|</span> 1hr 37min </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          \r\n            <p class=\"hidden md:block mb-2 pt-2\">\r\n              <span class=\"synopsis-short\">\r\n                Fall 2 returns audiences to the vertigo-inducing world of one of the most unexpectedly intense thrillers of recent years. The original Fall (2022) became a surprise hit thanks to its brilliantly simple yet terrifying premise?two friends stranded atop...              </span>\r\n\r\n                              <span class=\"synopsis-full hidden text-base\">\r\n                  Fall 2 returns audiences to the vertigo-inducing world of one of the most unexpectedly intense thrillers of recent years. The original Fall (2022) became a surprise hit thanks to its brilliantly simple yet terrifying premise?two friends stranded atop a 2,000-foot abandoned radio tower with no way down?and its dizzying use of real locations and practical filmmaking to create relentless tension. Directed by Scott Mann, the film became a viral sensation as audiences shared their reactions to its nerve-shredding suspense, turning the modestly budgeted thriller into a cult favourite and a huge streaming success around the world.\r\n\r\nThe sequel expands the concept into an even bigger survival thriller, with Scott Mann returning to direct and producers promising an even more ambitious scale while maintaining the intense realism that made the first film so effective. The original movie?s terrifying premise?where even looking down felt dangerous?sparked conversations about humanity?s primal fear of heights, and the sequel aims to push that sensation even further with new locations, new characters and even more extreme scenarios. With audiences now primed for the franchise?s unique brand of white-knuckle suspense, Fall 2 promises another edge-of-your-seat cinematic experience designed to leave viewers gripping their armrests from start to finish.                </span>\r\n\r\n                <button \r\n                  type=\"button\"\r\n                  class=\"ml-2 text-ompYellow underline text-base\"\r\n                  onclick=\"toggleSynopsis(this)\"\r\n                >\r\n                  See more\r\n                </button>\r\n                          </p>\r\n          <div class=\"hallTypeIcon hidden\">\r\n                                  </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <!-- C -->\r\n      <div class=\"col-span-3 md:col-span-5 md:col-start-1\">\r\n        <div class=\"w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 sm:col-span-2 xl:grid-cols-3  gap-2\">\r\n          <a aria-label=\"Fall 2: Deadpoint at 13:10 in Screen 7\" href=\"https://www.omniplexcinemas.co.uk/booking/seats/sutton/48100\" class=\"\"> \r\n<div id=\"perf_0\" class=\"showTimeBox bg-ompGray-times p-2 col-span-1 rounded-xl\">\r\n  <div class=\"topSection flex justify-between items-end\">\r\n    <div class=\"flex items-end\">\r\n      <div class=\"flex items-baseline\">\r\n        <h4 class=\"bigText mr-1 leading-none\" aria-label=\"Fall 2: Deadpoint at 13:10 in Screen 7\">\r\n          13:10        </h4>\r\n        <p class=\"smallText leading-none\" aria-label=\"Fall 2: Deadpoint starts at 13:10 and ends at 14:47\">\r\n          - 14:47        </p>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"flex items-end\">\r\n              <div class=\"flex items-baseline\">\r\n          <p class=\"smallText mr-1 leading-none\" aria-label=\"Cost starting from &pound;6.95\">\r\n            From\r\n          </p>\r\n          <h4 class=\"bigText leading-none\" aria-label=\"Cost starting from &pound;6.95\">\r\n            &pound;6.95          </h4>\r\n        </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"midSection flex justify-between items-baseline\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"mb-2\"></div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"bottomSection flex items-center justify-betw