at their very survival depends on them sticking together as they navigate their now unrecognisabl...              </span>\r\n\r\n                              <span class=\"synopsis-full hidden text-base\">\r\n                  After a mysterious cosmic event rips Oak Street from suburbia and transports their neighbourhood to someplace unknown, the Platt family soon discovers that their very survival depends on them sticking together as they navigate their now unrecognisable surroundings.                </span>\r\n\r\n                <button \r\n                  type=\"button\"\r\n                  class=\"ml-2 text-ompYellow underline text-base\"\r\n                  onclick=\"toggleSynopsis(this)\"\r\n                >\r\n                  See more\r\n                </button>\r\n                          </p>\r\n          <div class=\"hallTypeIcon hidden\">\r\n                                          <img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_dbox-orange.svg\" class=\"h-4 w-auto my-2\" alt=\"Event Type Icon\" />\r\n                                                </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <!-- C -->\r\n      <div class=\"col-span-3 md:col-span-5 md:col-start-1\">\r\n        <div class=\"w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 sm:col-span-2 xl:grid-cols-3  gap-2\">\r\n          <a aria-label=\"The End Of Oak Street at 13:50 in DBOX 12\" href=\"https://www.omniplexcinemas.co.uk/booking/seats/sutton/48107\" class=\"\"> \r\n<div id=\"perf_0\" class=\"showTimeBox bg-ompGray-times p-2 col-span-1 rounded-xl\">\r\n  <div class=\"topSection flex justify-between items-end\">\r\n    <div class=\"flex items-end\">\r\n      <div class=\"flex items-baseline\">\r\n        <h4 class=\"bigText mr-1 leading-none\" aria-label=\"The End Of Oak Street at 13:50 in DBOX 12\">\r\n          13:50        </h4>\r\n        <p class=\"smallText leading-none\" aria-label=\"The End Of Oak Street starts at 13:50 and ends at 15:29\">\r\n          - 15:29