he Beast Of Mossy Bottom sees the residents of Mossy Bottom Farm looking forward to Halloween - until the clumsy Farmer trashes the Flock's beloved pumpkin patch! When Shaun turns mad scientist to fix the problem, things rapidly spi...              </span>\r\n\r\n                              <span class=\"synopsis-full hidden text-base\">\r\n                  Shaun The Sheep: The Beast Of Mossy Bottom sees the residents of Mossy Bottom Farm looking forward to Halloween - until the clumsy Farmer trashes the Flock's beloved pumpkin patch! When Shaun turns mad scientist to fix the problem, things rapidly spiral out of control... With The Farmer missing and a wild beast roaming the woods of Mossingham, all the ingredients are in place for a monstrously fun family adventure.                </span>\r\n\r\n                <button \r\n                  type=\"button\"\r\n                  class=\"ml-2 text-ompYellow underline text-base\"\r\n                  onclick=\"toggleSynopsis(this)\"\r\n                >\r\n                  See more\r\n                </button>\r\n                          </p>\r\n          <div class=\"hallTypeIcon hidden\">\r\n                                  </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <!-- C -->\r\n      <div class=\"col-span-3 md:col-span-5 md:col-start-1\">\r\n        <div class=\"w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 sm:col-span-2 xl:grid-cols-3  gap-2\">\r\n          <a aria-label=\"Shaun the Sheep: The Beast of Mossy Bottom at 15:40 in Screen 7\" href=\"https://www.omniplexcinemas.co.uk/booking/seats/sutton/48422\" class=\"\"> \r\n<div id=\"perf_0\" class=\"showTimeBox bg-ompGray-times p-2 col-span-1 rounded-xl\">\r\n  <div class=\"topSection flex justify-between items-end\">\r\n    <div class=\"flex items-end\">\r\n      <div class=\"flex items-baseline\">\r\n        <h4 class=\"bigText mr-1 leading-none\" aria-label=\"Shaun the Sheep: The Beast of Mossy Bottom at 15:40 in Screen 7\">\r\n          15:40        </h4